{"id": "1535324980022083615", "channel_id": "1535324980022083615", "author_id": "1209233760805986365", "author_name": "miuvrae", "content": "Hi I need advice on what to save my pulls for and perhaps some teams I can do atm since Im starting to struggle a bit on chapter end bosses for ex. the divine fetus where I had to use an emergency gnosis. Currently just have a ton of standard pulls and not so much silver and I been playing for abt a week", "timestamp": "2026-08-07T16:33:20.196000+00:00", "thread_id": "1535324980022083615", "attachments": [{"id": "1535324980911407294", "filename": "IMG_0634.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 3042762, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1535324980022083615/1535324980911407294/IMG_0634.png?ex=6a780310&is=6a76b190&hm=17455a53376915b5d8c464dd9a312a3a40a810c1b28934dca3734fa2fbfaf881&"}, {"id": "1535324981893005363", "filename": "IMG_0635.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 2949311, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1535324980022083615/1535324981893005363/IMG_0635.png?ex=6a780310&is=6a76b190&hm=58f9eb5d18de1003bcf4d2fd469397fd99589e21fe7968acc03a66356f6dd559&"}, {"id": "1535324982673023179", "filename": "IMG_0636.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 2368095, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1535324980022083615/1535324982673023179/IMG_0636.png?ex=6a780310&is=6a76b190&hm=d109fa3ffd80114b9ebdcb4fa49dd3012c9bbb6443b691f8ca81f5c3a61ef13a&"}], "thread_title": "Team/pulling advice", "forum_channel_id": "1356200968311803956", "thread_tags": ["1400747489132412979", "1400747088995811358"], "is_thread_starter": true}
{"id": "1535342212118741022", "channel_id": "1535324980022083615", "author_id": "304652156286533642", "author_name": "sbpan", "content": "Hello there : )\n\nMy first advice would be to pull a bit of everything from standard. You will eventually want 5 functionnal teams ( 19 awakeners + 1 you can borrow from someone else ) so you'd likely be better off getting intimate with all four realms.\n\nDid you find Cheri's handbook ? just type /new and explore the contents.", "timestamp": "2026-08-07T17:41:48.648000+00:00", "thread_id": "1535324980022083615", "thread_title": "Team/pulling advice", "forum_channel_id": "1356200968311803956", "thread_tags": ["1400747489132412979", "1400747088995811358"]}
{"id": "1535342816857817170", "channel_id": "1535324980022083615", "author_id": "304652156286533642", "author_name": "sbpan", "content": "About the luminous cores/etheral cores ( limited pulls ) the next banner features Mouchette who is hailed by most as the strongest dps available.\nMy opinion is more nuanced but she still deals a lot of damage and is rather easy to handle. So it might be worth to wait for her.\nYou can try one of the event and borrow her to check if you like her playstyle.\n\nHorla is coming back in that same banner and she's a versatile support, able to help any team. Might be worth investing in her as well.", "timestamp": "2026-08-07T17:44:12.829000+00:00", "thread_id": "1535324980022083615", "thread_title": "Team/pulling advice", "forum_channel_id": "1356200968311803956", "thread_tags": ["1400747489132412979", "1400747088995811358"]}
{"id": "1535343060542820422", "channel_id": "1535324980022083615", "author_id": "304652156286533642", "author_name": "sbpan", "content": "And now, teams.\nI say you don't bother about that right now. Just olaying the game with many different awakeners will get you a feel of how each work and what they lack.\nThat will make it easier to then choose 1 or 2 to build around.", "timestamp": "2026-08-07T17:45:10.928000+00:00", "thread_id": "1535324980022083615", "thread_title": "Team/pulling advice", "forum_channel_id": "1356200968311803956", "thread_tags": ["1400747489132412979", "1400747088995811358"]}
{"id": "1535343090611523786", "channel_id": "1535324980022083615", "author_id": "304652156286533642", "author_name": "sbpan", "content": "Do you have specific questions ?", "timestamp": "2026-08-07T17:45:18.097000+00:00", "thread_id": "1535324980022083615", "thread_title": "Team/pulling advice", "forum_channel_id": "1356200968311803956", "thread_tags": ["1400747489132412979", "1400747088995811358"]}
